        "text": "Justice Alito noted that the government would argue for distinguishing the other six statutes if the Court disagreed with the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5562cf6cd09385c8179644f828094b21cf14dc1ee9ff727ba7615e3bc90b02d5",
